WEBVTT

00:00.839 --> 00:03.204
ai function f(x) songayito jokhon

00:03.204 --> 00:06.709
f(x)= 49- x ^2(x er borgo)

00:06.799 --> 00:09.646
Ber koro f of 5 er maan

00:09.646 --> 00:10.949
tahole function niye

00:10.949 --> 00:12.373
kajer somoy tumi input nebe.

00:12.373 --> 00:14.573
ekhetre amader input hobe 5

00:14.573 --> 00:17.062
amra amader function box- e eta nibo

00:17.062 --> 00:20.371
tahole amra folafol pabo

00:20.371 --> 00:23.111
ebong tara ekta function amader dieche

00:23.111 --> 00:25.648
je tomar input nibe ar taake borgo kore..

00:25.648 --> 00:28.302
ta 49 theke biyog koro.

00:28.302 --> 00:31.013
tahole f(5)

00:31.013 --> 00:32.583
jokhonee ami kono "x" dekhi,

00:32.583 --> 00:34.217
jehetu, f(x) er soman,

00:34.217 --> 00:35.851
ami jokhone kono "x" dhekbo,

00:35.851 --> 00:37.717
ami eta input er sathe bodlabo.

00:37.717 --> 00:41.560
tahole f(5) hobe 49 biyog....

00:41.560 --> 00:45.315
"x" er borgo na likhe ami 5 er borgo nibo

00:45.315 --> 00:49.622
tahole eta hobe 49-25.

00:49.652 --> 00:55.932
aar 49 biyog 25 holo 24

00:55.938 --> 01:02.178
aar amader kaj shesh
